# * Local Nuxt env. Copy to `.env` and fill in real values.
# * Every variable here is read by the Nuxt app — all of them are NUXT_PUBLIC_
# * and therefore exposed to the browser bundle. Never add a secret to this file.
# *
# * Edge-function secrets do NOT belong here: functions read Deno.env, fed by
# * `supabase secrets set`. See PRODUCTION_ENV_MIGRATION.md for that list.

# --- Supabase (Nuxt side) ---
# * @nuxtjs/supabase reads these two first, before SUPABASE_URL / SUPABASE_KEY.
NUXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://hznvltijxkeadqpwctop.supabase.co
NUXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_KEY=sb_publishable_xxx                    # * anon / publishable key

# --- Public base URL ---
# * OVERRIDES `site.url` in nuxt.config.ts, so it drives sitemap / robots /
# * schema-org canonicals AND the order magic links built in checkout, ClubCard
# * and promo-codes. In production this must be the real shop domain, not the
# * Netlify subdomain (https://intesport-web.netlify.app).
NUXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://www.intersportclubidf.com

# --- SystemPay (Lyra) Smartform — browser side ---
NUXT_PUBLIC_SYSTEMPAY_ENDPOINT=api.systempay.fr                # * bare hostname, no scheme
NUXT_PUBLIC_SYSTEMPAY_PUBLIC_KEY=12345678:testpublickey_xxxxx  # * test mode prefix → swap for prod
